    <li><a href="https://www.marieclaire.com/fashion/how-to-style-capri-pants/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Marie Claire: Capri pants on Spring 2026 runways</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.instyle.com/activewear-trends-spring-2026-11918103" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">InStyle: Activewear trends beyond the matching-set era</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://wwd.com/fashion-news/fashion-trends/capri-workout-leggings-trend-activewear-rihanna-beyonce-1239064552/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WWD: Capri workout leggings and activewear</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.whowhatwear.com/fashion/celebrity-style/capri-leggings-trend-jennifer-lawrence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Who What Wear: Capri leggings and celebrity styling</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.nike.com/w/womens-3-4-length-dri-fit-leggings-1evrhz32dxrz5e1x6z5nhdu" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Nike: Women's 3/4-length and capri leggings</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://shop.lululemon.com/c/women-capris/n1ml6n" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">lululemon: Women's capris and crop lengths</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.aloyoga.com/products/w51024r-alosoft-high-waist-iconic-90s-capri-black" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Alo Yoga: High-waist capri product example</a></li>
  </ul>
</EditorialArticleLayout>

